en:
A presence of unearthly menace,{w}its massive body twisted and contorted,
was poking its face out of a tiny burrow.{w}{p}Where and how did that body fit inside?{w}Surely it worked by some law
beyond all reckoning.{w}

The fog was thick.{w}It seemed the thing at the heart of the fog{w}was where it came from.{w}{p}All sorts of shadows flickered in the fog.{w}With every passing moment, they changed shape.{w}{p}When the source waved a finger, the shadows vanished.{w}Perhaps even the source itself
was only an illusion.{w}{p}As if it had read that thought,
the source blasted out a great burst of fog.{w}And it grinned.{w}

An old man was sitting quietly.{w}{p}He gave off a presence as though
he had been sitting there
for hundreds of years.{w}{p}The old man's eyes slowly opened{w}and fixed upon you.{w}!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!{w}

{0E}The presence of darkness has grown thicker.{0F}
Without enough strength, experience and resolve,
it would be dangerous to go any further. {w}

The Opinion Bits each began to give off light
and started exchanging auras.{w}{p}Before long, the Opinion Bits
all turned toward Zaalhaut at once.{w}
